<title>CANADA: Revenue Props buys back up to 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Revenue Props buys back up to 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revenue Properties Co Ltd said on Monday that it filed for a normal course issuer bid to acquire up to two million shares, or about 3.1 percent of outstanding common shares, for cancellation.</p>
<p>The real estate company added that the buy-back will start July 29 and finish July 28. Shares will be bought at market price at the time of acquisition.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
